&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5344&quot;&gt;3+ years of professional software-engineering experience building production services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5434&quot;&gt;Proficiency in at least one backend language (Go, Rust, Python, Java, etc.) and familiarity with a cloud platform (AWS or equivalent).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5572&quot;&gt;Solid fundamentals in data structures, concurrency, API design, and testing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5652&quot;&gt;Experience debugging real production problems and a willingness to carry an on-call rotation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5749&quot;&gt;Working familiarity with observability tooling and comfort reading dashboards, logs, and traces.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5849&quot;&gt;Ability to break down an ambiguous task, ask good questions, and drive it to done.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5935&quot;&gt;Clear written and verbal communication, and a genuine interest in learning from feedback.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
